// The scoreboard screen: the five metrics, the confidence-versus-accuracy table, and the definition of the metric the learner asked about. Only what the log can show counts; there is no streak, no points, no minutes studied and no completion figure on it, by design (spec P9).

// Draw the scoreboard for the state: the list of metrics, the table and the open definition, all read from the lines the engine layer wrote.
gym_paint_score(Session gym_state) {
  gym_paint_list(gym_state);
  gym_paint_table(gym_state);
  gym_paint_definition(gym_state);
} return void;
